>  <EVIDENCE_NOTES>
The primary study supports two η⁶ boron-containing rings and two CO ligands and discusses neutral diene donation and metal backbonding. The release adopts the Mo(+4)/aromatic dianion formal assignment. The input singlet has not been independently verified.

