>  <SELECTION_REASON>
Manually reviewed Lewis representation. Fe–N–O 178.12°, N–O 1.18556 Å, g-xTB N–O WBO 1.6392. The closed-shell assignment for this near-linear terminal ligand is N≡[O+], with metal formal charge -2 and total charge +0. The neutral DNIC with the same two monodentate phosphines and its oxidized product have different overall oxidation levels; Two NO⁺ groups correspond to Fe(−II). The revised table assigns Fe(II) and two NO⁻. Localized 24 aromatic-ring bonds using WBOs and original bond lengths. A source representation differs from the reference. The atom order and coordinates of all 59 atoms agree between XYZ and SDF. Lengths of 58 nonmetal covalent bonds: 56 within range, 0 outside range and 2 with sparse controls.

